translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_gem_finished_836b55a4:

    # "You dropped the gem into the loupe, and it fits perfectly!"
    "你把宝石放进放大镜里，严丝合缝！"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_gem_finished_4c68247d:

    # "Perhaps now you can use it..."
    "也许现在你可以用它了……"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_loupe_gem_912a6c3e:

    # "You unlodge the gem from the loupe, and placed it back into where it belonged."
    "你把宝石从放大镜里取出来，放回了原本的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_loupe_gem_aa17b5a1:

    # "You pick up the scroll under the table, there seem to be some old stains on it that you could only see under the green gem."
    "你捡起桌下的卷轴，上面似乎有些古老的污渍，只有透过绿宝石才能看见。"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_loupe_gem_4600f043:

    # "Patting away the dust, you suddenly feel a sense of familiarity wash over you, as if you have seen this scroll before, or you've written it yourself."
    "你拍去灰尘，突然感到一阵熟悉感涌上心头，仿佛你以前见过这卷轴，或者它就是你亲手写的。"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_loupe_gem_89393dc4:

    # e "Is this... Furkan's?"
    e "这是弗坎的吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_loupe_gem_8cc22a2c:

    # "You feel the scroll is calling out to you, and so you decide to keep it."
    "你感觉卷轴在呼唤你，于是决定把它留下。"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_loupe_gem_1b97fc2a:

    # msg "The stained scroll keepsake is added to your inventory. You can use the item to experience its past."
    msg "沾污的卷轴纪念品已加入你的物品栏。你可以使用该物品，体验它的过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_e7d8f37d:

    # "You see the general stands besides the curtain. He seems exhausted. His mask is off, and he looks at you with a stern expression."
    "你看到将军站在帘子旁。他看起来筋疲力尽，面具也摘了下来，正神情严肃地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_dfee6459:

    # k "What do you want?"
    k "你想干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_0e38e34a:

    # e "I'm here to see the chief. Is he alright?"
    e "我来看看酋长。他没事吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_9462a50d:

    # "He looks at you, and then at the curtain, and then back at you."
    "他看了看你，又看了看帘子，随后再次看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_edcec538:

    # k "No, he's not. Go away. Stop bothering him."
    k "不，他不好。滚开。别再烦他。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_82889954:

    # e "Wait, what happened."
    e "等等，发生什么事了？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_5ee1001c:

    # k "What happened? You happened. You and your stupid village."
    k "发生什么事？还不是因为你。因为你和你那愚蠢的村子。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_2cec54b4:

    # k "You almost killed my chief, you know that? Did your bull tell you that?"
    k "你差点杀了我的酋长，知道吗？你的公牛没告诉你？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_7c0f3fb0:

    # e "Look, I'm sorry. I didn't even know he hid this from you."
    e "听我说，对不起。我甚至不知道他把这件事瞒着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_16ea7224:

    # k "You know what? I don't care. Just get out of here."
    k "你知道吗？我不在乎。赶紧离开这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_515435af:

    # "Kari turns around and walks away from you."
    "卡里转过身，离你而去。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_e6d22e0b:

    # msg "Work in Progress!"
    msg "开发中！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_5bfd4017:

    # "There's a loupe on the table, but it doesn't work."
    "桌上有一把放大镜，但它坏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_f1444e06:

    # "You notice an empty slot within the loupe, it seems like something is missing."
    "你注意到放大镜里有个空槽，似乎少了什么东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_631dc9b6:

    # "Perhaps you could find a way to fix it, or maybe find someone knowledgeable enough to help."
    "也许你能想办法修好它，或者找个足够懂行的人帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_kechioeren_conference_29fde476:

    # "With a gem lodged into the loupe, you try to use it to look around the room."
    "把宝石嵌入放大镜后，你试着用它观察房间四周。"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_search_loop_e9e31053:

    # "Around the mountains of goat tribe, you notice that there's a green bush nearby, and you approach to pick one up."
    "在山羊部落的山间，你注意到附近有一丛绿灌木，便走过去采了一株。"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_search_loop_6fcfb0c6:

    # "You put it in your bag, you now have [item_number] Horehound."
    "你把它放进袋子里，现在有 [item_number] 株霍特霍恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_search_loop_4536ffcd:

    # "You put it in your bag, you now have [item_number] Horehounds."
    "你把它放进袋子里，现在有 [item_number] 株霍特霍恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite kechioeren_search_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一会儿，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_4ef3920d:

    # "You walk towards the gate, you see two guards standing there, staring at you."
    "你朝大门走去，看见两名卫兵站在那里，正盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_aacb2565:

    # e "Hey... May I enter?"
    e "嘿……我可以进去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_7a352d19:

    # "The guard reluctantly picks up a piece of paper from his pocket, and compares your face with the drawing on it."
    "卫兵不情愿地从口袋里掏出一张纸，把你的脸和上面的画像对照了一番。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_13971371:

    # goatguard "The Chief and General is resting, but... they ordered you may enter... as a visitor."
    goatguard "酋长和将军正在休息，不过……他们吩咐过，你可以作为访客进去……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_a3f91334:

    # goatguard "The Chief is resting, but he ordered that you may enter our tribe, as a visitor."
    goatguard "酋长正在休息，但他吩咐过，你可以以访客身份进入我们部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_b9f1536b:

    # goatguard "But... Uhm... we'll be watching you."
    goatguard "不过……呃……我们会盯着你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_20caf69f:

    # goatguard "So, don't do anything weird."
    goatguard "所以，别做什么奇怪的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_7e187960:

    # goatguard "Especially after last time... when you beat us pretty hard."
    goatguard "尤其是上次……你把我们打得够呛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_f799ca3c:

    # e "Oh... I'm sorry."
    e "哦……对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_e21d79be:

    # goatguard "Plus, we beat you so hard last time when you trespass..."
    goatguard "再说了，上次你擅闯时，我们也把你打得够呛……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_7acf90b1:

    # e "Well you're just lucky you have your general..."
    e "哼，那只是因为你们有将军撑腰，算你们走运……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_caf1e4be:

    # goatguard "Whatever. Watch out your ass in our tribe, else it's not just us two you're fighting."
    goatguard "随便你。在我们部落里给我小心点，不然你要对付的就不只是我们两个了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Welcome_2e26a92a:

    # e "Uhmmm.... Ok."
    e "呃……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_23413a48:

    # f "Courier, Welcome. Please, take a seat."
    f "信使，欢迎。请坐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_c6f94e6f:

    # e "Chief..."
    e "酋长……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_1efd9bbe:

    # f "Call me Furkan. We do not require you to be formal."
    f "叫我弗坎就好。你不用这么正式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_07ae76aa:

    # e "Uhmmm.... It's alright, I'll just look around."
    e "呃……没事，我就随便四处看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_ccdcb24c:

    # f "Sure."
    f "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_f2de3991:

    # f "Guards...?"
    f "卫兵……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_87bfc1e3:

    # "Furkan stares at the accompanying guards for a second, before they quickly walk out of the hut."
    "弗坎盯着随行警卫一秒钟,然后他们迅速走出小屋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_48a2c4af:

    # f "So..."
    f "那么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_6eac4101:

    # f "Thank you so much for helping with getting me out of the cave."
    f "非常感谢你帮我离开山洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_33dd9d5d:

    # f "The general told me you beat him quite severely, no?"
    f "将军告诉我，你把他打得很重，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_24ed6012:

    # e "Hmm... He asked for a fight..."
    e "嗯……是他主动要求打的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_de57760b:

    # f "The general told me you fought the monster in the cave quite bravely."
    f "将军告诉我，你勇敢地和山洞里的怪物战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_e424ec5b:

    # e "We did it together, actually. He helped with me... a lot."
    e "其实是我们一起做到的。他帮了我……很多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_7cf0b6cd:

    # f "I know. Still, you have proved your worth here."
    f "我知道。不过，你已经证明了自己的价值。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_08ca6612:

    # f "So, if we needed anything, you would be happy to lend a hand...?"
    f "所以，如果我们有什么需要，你愿意帮个忙……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_05245476:

    # e "Hmm... Why me?"
    e "嗯……为什么是我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_10dcb4b0:

    # f "Well, let say, I need an example from Lusterfield."
    f "这么说吧 我需要一个来自乐斯民菲尔德的例子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_f595ef63:

    # f "To prove my commitment to make peace with your village."
    f "这是为了证明我与贵村和解的决心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_1ebc4141:

    # f "And to show that we can be friendly after all."
    f "也是为了表明，我们终究可以友好相处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_0062e4e6:

    # e "Uhm... What if I say no?"
    e "呃……如果我说不呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_a0fe8375:

    # f "Sure, you can."
    f "当然可以。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_2d273805:

    # "The Chief smirks at you, he seems to know where your mind is heading... It's not really possible you would say no."
    "酋长冲你咧嘴一笑，似乎已经猜到你的心思了……你根本不可能说不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_480be166:

    # "And he knows it."
    "而且，他知道这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_fa2a6aae:

    # "Furkan looks down at his paper once again..."
    "弗坎再次低头看他的报纸..."

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_bdf6a85b:

    # f "Couri-"
    f "信使——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_b9df45c1:

    # "You catch Furkan staring at your naked self, that's when you realise you haven't put your clothes on."
    "你发现弗坎盯着你裸体的自我, 那就是当你意识到你没有穿衣服的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_3ec57d49:

    # f "..."
    f "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_1969bdbc:

    # "His cheeks become a lot redder, and the chief averts his gaze almost immediately."
    "他的脸颊一下子红了许多，酋长几乎立刻就移开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_bb052833:

    # f "Watch out for the weather, it's getting cold, courier."
    f "注意天气，信使。天要冷起来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_fbfb4027:

    # e "Y-yes."
    e "是、是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_261ee5af:

    # "He waits a few seconds before turning to you, and accidentally leaves a glance on your cock."
    "他等了几秒才转过身来，视线却不小心落在了你的阴茎上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_7c56f12b:

    # "You can hear a loud gulp."
    "你听见一声响亮的吞咽声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_04558c1e:

    # f "...Alright."
    f "……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Normal_Talk_f85cdcd1:

    # f "How are you doing, Courier." nointeract
    f "信使，最近过得怎么样？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_1577a57f:

    # e "Please be careful, Furkan, and warn your general too. I am afraid Lothar is coming."
    e "请小心,弗坎,也警告你的将军 恐怕洛萨尔要来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_8dd38bbf:

    # f "Lot- Lothar? What does he have to do with us?"
    f "洛萨尔,他和我们有什么关系?"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_e2c849c1:

    # f "The last time I heard of him, he accused us of planting the stone. But we have nothing to do with it."
    f "我上次听到关于他的消息时，他指责我们安放了那块石头。但这跟我们无关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_62e5c77c:

    # e "I believe you, but he sounded very upset about the vote in Lusterfield. Based on his track record... he might come here to take it out on you."
    e "我相信,但他听起来对乐斯民菲尔德的投票很不高兴 根据他的履历..."

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_905ed109:

    # f "I did not expect to find myself another enemy by doing nothing, but I understand now, I will warn the general as well."
    f "我没想到自己什么都没做，却会平白多出一个敌人，不过我现在明白了，我也会警告将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_e3d92251:

    # e "He sounded very upset about the vote in Lusterfield. Based on his track record... he might come here to take it out on you."
    e "他对乐斯民菲尔德的投票感到非常不安 根据他的记录 他可能来找你麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_905ed109_1:

    # f "I did not expect to find myself another enemy by doing nothing, but I understand now, I will warn the general as well."
    f "我没想到自己什么都没做，却会平白多出一个敌人，不过我现在明白了，我也会警告将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_515e655b:

    # e "Stay safe, Furkan."
    e "保持安全, 弗坎."

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_f54bcd16:

    # "Seeing the worry in his eyes, you can't help but feel a pang of guilt, as if it was all because of your decision."
    "看到他眼中的忧虑，你不禁感到一阵愧疚，仿佛一切都是你的决定造成的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_668c363c:

    # f "Thank you, Courier. I will make sure the tribe is ready for whatever comes."
    f "谢谢你，信使。我会确保部落准备好应对接下来的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_da537325:

    # f "And, if it had to come down to it, we will have no choice but to fight back. We won't underestimate one wolf."
    f "如果事情真走到那一步，我们也别无选择，只能反击。我们不会小看一匹狼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_2dfa8b79:

    # e "I hope it doesn't come to that."
    e "希望不会走到那一步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Warn_Lothar_Hunt_2ddbcce4:

    # "He closes his eyes and nods."
    "他闭上眼睛，点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_8f22601c:

    # f "[e], you're just on time."
    f "[e]，你来得正是时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_d161fb8c:

    # f "The tribe has discussed it and we believe we need to make headway into the dark forest to find out more about the magical stone."
    f "部落已经讨论过了，我们认为需要深入黑暗森林，进一步调查那块魔法石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_c746db02:

    # f "It might be related to something that happened in the cave."
    f "这可能与山洞里发生的某件事有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_c9544fd5:

    # f "The stone, our basins, the golem. All of it may connect to something in there."
    f "那块石头、我们的水盆、魔像……这一切或许都和里面的某件事有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_b3a93a86:

    # f "Again, we ask for your help."
    f "我们再一次请求你的帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_ce0a52eb:

    # e "Me?"
    e "我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_973d13ec:

    # f "Yes. As I said, the tribe can't spare any men at the moment to venture into the dark forest."
    f "是。正如我所说，目前部落抽不出人手进入黑暗森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_3358d6f0:

    # f "But we've done everything we could to make it easier for you."
    f "但我们已经尽可能把路给你铺平了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_9d73b3dc:

    # k "The guards have cleared the way to the dark forest."
    k "卫兵已经清理出通往黑暗森林的路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_22906b41:

    # "Kari walks over and marks out a path on your map."
    "卡里走过来，在你的地图上标出一条路线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_6e3964d9:

    # k "You shouldn't have any trouble using this path. But when you're in the forest itself, be careful."
    k "走这条路应该不会遇到什么麻烦。不过进入森林后，一定要小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_c7730bf7:

    # k "With your fighting capability, you should be able to handle yourself. But practice caution."
    k "以你的战斗能力，应该能保护好自己。但务必谨慎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_c1af551d:

    # k "I hope you've been training since our last battle. The enemies in the dark enemies are far more dangerous and unforgiving than I am."
    k "希望自从我们上次交手以来，你一直在训练。黑暗森林里的敌人比我危险得多，也绝不会手下留情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_0af36474:

    # e "Thank you."
    e "谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Werewolf_Quest_890f741e:

    # f "No, we need to thank you. I hope you'll find something out of this and we can work closer to a truce between the tribe and Lusterfield."
    f "不,我们需要谢谢你,我希望你会从中找到一些东西,我们可以更接近于 部落和乐斯民菲尔德之间的休战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_c55d3c09:

    # e "Furkan, how is it being the chief of the goat tribe?"
    e "弗坎 山羊部落的首领怎么样了?"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_3ec57d49:

    # f "..."
    f "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_4830a8a8:

    # f "Being a Chief. I am not the best at this job."
    f "当酋长。我不太擅长这份工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_a950b4ba:

    # f "But after father died, someone has to take over the tribe."
    f "但父亲去世后，总得有人接管部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_e7b347c0:

    # e "What was it like, before you become chieftain?"
    e "在你成为酋长之前，日子是什么样的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_ee74f590:

    # f "I tell you this only because I trust you will not tell any other."
    f "我只告诉你这些，是因为我相信你不会告诉别人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_f560317b:

    # e "Uhm... sure."
    e "呃……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_2f172d20:

    # f "It was never my choice to be a chief. I was out adventuring, discovering the whole world."
    f "当酋长从来不是我的选择。那时我在外冒险，探索整个世界。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_9a731bb0:

    # f "Just that a certain circumstances occured, between me and my father."
    f "只是后来我和父亲之间发生了一些事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_7bda1598:

    # f "And, he decided to attack on the Lusterfield village soon after."
    f "不久之后,他决定攻击乐斯民菲尔德村。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_63f175fd:

    # e "What circumstances...?"
    e "什么事……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_da8998eb:

    # f "About him retiring."
    f "关于他要退休的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_4e7d97f1:

    # f "We had an argument, quite severely actually, I left my tribe afterwards."
    f "我们大吵了一架，而且吵得很凶。之后我离开了部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_42dfff8a:

    # e "I'm sorry about what happened to your father..."
    e "对你父亲的遭遇，我很抱歉……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_2f75163c:

    # f "I only wish the last words we shared was different."
    f "我只希望我们最后说的那些话，不是那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_3ec57d49_1:

    # f "..."
    f "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_bb4d40e9:

    # f "You asked about me being a chief now, did I change the subject...?"
    f "你刚才问我现在当酋长的事，我是不是把话题扯远了……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_749b3029:

    # e "Kinda, but you go ahead..."
    e "算是吧，不过你继续说……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_17f8699d:

    # f "Someone has to be the chief. I understand if I am not the best leader as my father."
    f "总得有人来当酋长。如果我没能像父亲那样成为一名好领袖，我也能理解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_b89555a7:

    # f "But, I will make my tribe flourish again. No matter the cost."
    f "但我会让我的部落再次繁荣起来。不惜一切代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Chief_008fe06a:

    # e "I trust you will, Furkan."
    e "我相信你能做到，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_94be90a5:

    # e "So... Furkan, How is the goat tribe going...?"
    e "弗坎,山羊部落怎么样了?"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_3bab8e64:

    # f "Decent, I should say. After you came, and after all the trouble that followed... The tribe changed drastically."
    f "还算不错吧。自从你来了，以及之后发生的那些麻烦……部落发生了翻天覆地的变化。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_e0c76982:

    # f "I should not be surprised by any means. The bears got it worse."
    f "我不该感到意外。熊族的情况更糟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_1d0e5d7c:

    # e "Hmm...?"
    e "嗯……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_779d3e75:

    # f "Our Tribe is entirely run by the magic in the primordial runes. My bow was one of them."
    f "我们部落完全依靠原初符文中的魔力运转。我的弓就是其中之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_14ad9db5:

    # f "But everyone has to preserve their magic usage now, our only source of energy is the ancient tree."
    f "但现在大家都必须节省魔力，唯一的能量来源就是那棵古树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_ff94180a:

    # e "Is this why you need to reconcile with Lusterfield...?"
    e "所以你才需要和乐斯民菲尔德和解吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_332c558b:

    # e "Because you want to take over the ancient tree?"
    e "因为你想接管那棵古树？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_0aa353d2:

    # f "No. Not take over, I only need to harvest those remaining energy, and those Lusterfolks never used them anyway."
    f "不。不是接管，我只是需要收集剩下的能量，而且那些乐斯民菲尔德人反正也没用过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_ddcb5e0d:

    # f "Even then, it doesn't provide enough magic for everyone in the tribe, along with the high maintanence cost just to transport the energy."
    f "即便如此，它提供的魔力也不够部落所有人使用，更别提运输能量本身还要付出高昂的维护成本。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_225f00cd:

    # f "I hope we can find the primordial runes."
    f "希望我们能找到原初符文。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_2730a023:

    # e "Is it really that important to your tribe..?"
    e "对你们部落来说，真的有那么重要吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_86a6fcd2:

    # f "Look at everything around you, it is maintained not by physical structure, but the magical energy that sustain the whole tribe."
    f "看看你周围的一切，这里不是靠实体结构维持的，而是靠支撑整个部落的魔法能量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_2c7425f2:

    # f "The Guardians... They used to guard those runes up on the mountain."
    f "守护者……他们曾经守护着山上的那些符文。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_faa85cfc:

    # f "They ran away, after the rune got stolen... and now... the basin that created them, got stolen away as well."
    f "符文被偷走后，他们就逃跑了……现在……孕育他们的水盆也被偷走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_c2168ed4:

    # f "I will handle it, one way or another. But I need a soldier, a soldier like you."
    f "我会想办法处理这件事。但我需要一名士兵，一个像你这样的士兵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_acbf65a9:

    # e "Me..."
    e "我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_8edad32a:

    # e "Do you really believe that I can bring prosper to your tribe...?"
    e "你真的相信我能让你的部落繁荣起来……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_dd250f12:

    # f "I need an adventurer, and a friend who I can trust."
    f "我需要一名冒险者，也需要一个我能信任的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_04b6d52a:

    # f "Everything that happened in this world after you arrived, they all connect back to you."
    f "你来到这个世界后发生的一切，都和你脱不了关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_05b26ca9:

    # f "You are the answer."
    f "你就是答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_d8ba1ffa:

    # e "I get it... but it seems like such a big responsibility."
    e "我明白了……但这责任未免太重了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_5887bf10:

    # f "Do not fret. Time will come when you'll prove your worth."
    f "别担心。总有一天，你会证明自己的价值。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_Goat_Tribe_e54fa2db:

    # e "...I understand."
    e "……我明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_9f459336:

    # f "Courier, what are you doing here?"
    f "信使，你在这里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_2191ddfc:

    # "A voice suddenly appears behind you. You turn around and are greeted by Furkan's inquisitive gaze."
    "你转过身来 被弗坎的好奇眼神欢迎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_9a4a72ab:

    # "You ponder what to do."
    "你思索着该怎么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_f1d595d2:

    # e "U-uh..."
    e "呃、呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1c20429a:

    # f "What are you doing in the outpost?" nointeract
    f "你在前哨做什么？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_64d6fd6f:

    # e "I'm here on Rahim's behest to collect a special kind of flower."
    e "我奉雷希姆之命来收集特别的花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b852df63:

    # "Furkan is clearly taken aback by your honesty."
    "弗坎显然被你的坦诚弄得措手不及。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_7f1f4bf9:

    # f "I am sure the bull would never have wanted you to tell me that."
    f "我相信那头公牛绝不会希望你把这件事告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_51ba7498:

    # f "But I am thankful that you did."
    f "但我很感激你告诉了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_0c4dff3f:

    # "Seeing the smile on Furkan's face, you believe you've made the right choice."
    "看见弗坎脸上的笑容 你相信自己做了正确的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_d025e883:

    # f "Come, I will help you. The flower that you are looking for is native to the land around the tribe."
    f "来，我帮你。你要找的花原产于部落周围这片土地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b953fdd4:

    # f "I will lead you there."
    f "我带你去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_9f7a838f:

    # "Furkan waves at you and you follow him through the woods."
    "弗坎朝你挥挥手，你跟着他穿过树林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_adf82238:

    # e "I'm just here foraging."
    e "我只是来采集东西的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_7396dacc:

    # "Furkan narrows his eyes at you. You sweat nervously but try to look calm on the surface."
    "弗坎眯起眼睛看着你。你紧张得直冒汗，却努力让表面看起来镇定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_3e8c84e5:

    # "Eventually, Furkan breaks into a small smile."
    "最终 弗坎 进入了一个小小的微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1b7b515c:

    # f "If you say so."
    f "你这么说的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_385c0737:

    # f "Can you tell me what you are foraging for?"
    f "能告诉我你在采什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_e42aa7d0:

    # "You ponder whether to tell him about the flower when Furkan continues."
    "你想想当弗坎继续的时候 是否要告诉他花的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_4759947f:

    # f "Perchance it is a flower that only grows around the tribe?"
    f "难道是只有部落附近才会生长的花？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_fe1957e0:

    # "Furkan shoots you a knowing smile. You can't help but see the disappointment in his eyes."
    "弗坎意味深长地朝你笑了笑。你不禁从他眼中看到了失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_14ecafde:

    # e "Erm... Yes..."
    e "呃……是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_5666b9a6:

    # f "The flower is the only unique thing growing around this area. I doubt you would be foraging for anything else."
    f "这片区域唯一独特的植物就是这种花。我不觉得你会来采别的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_65cfbf14:

    # f "Come with me. I will lead you to the flower bushes."
    f "跟我来。我带你去花丛那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_9f7a838f_1:

    # "Furkan waves at you and you follow him through the woods."
    "弗坎朝你挥挥手，你跟着他穿过树林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_c86fda0e:

    # "As you walk into the clearing, you take in a surprised gasp."
    "走进空地时，你惊讶地倒吸一口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1ad421c5:

    # "Furkan smiles at your reaction."
    "弗坎 对你的反应微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_57358218:

    # f "Amazing sight, is it not?"
    f "景色很美，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_93124f98:

    # "You can only nod."
    "你只能点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_57a69ec8:

    # "The clearing is covered in vibrant flower bushes. The flowers look like little balls of sunburst."
    "空地上遍布着色彩鲜艳的花丛，花朵看起来像一团团小小的旭日。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_689bc226:

    # "They give off a very relaxing fragrance."
    "它们散发着令人十分放松的香气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_e4e21ec1:

    # e "What are these..."
    e "这些是什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_9f8afdb5:

    # f "They are called mums. We use them in poultices to help with swelling, cold, fever and so on. They are also great decorative plant."
    f "它们叫菊花。我们把它们用于药敷，帮助消肿、治疗感冒、发烧等等。它们也是很棒的观赏植物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_bed71e3a:

    # f "You are here for them, are you not? Better get picking then."
    f "你就是为了它们来的，对吧？那就快点采吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_91572878:

    # e "I think Haskell taught me to come to this place as well."
    e "我想哈斯凯尔也教过我来这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_df39c768:

    # f "The old dragon and his love for flowers... But I can still help you harvest these beautiful mums."
    f "那条老龙和他对花的痴爱……不过我还是可以帮你采这些漂亮的菊花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_21dfb209:

    # "Furkan teaches you how to harvest the flowers. With his help, you soon have a bag full of them."
    "弗坎教你怎么摘花 在他的帮助下 你很快就有一袋花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1df5dbd0:

    # "Then, something comes to you."
    "这时，你突然想起一件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_c40670e3:

    # e "Furkan, shouldn't you be back at the tribe? How could you have time to help me with this? I shouldn't have taken up so much of your time."
    e "弗坎，你不是应该回部落吗？你怎么会有时间帮我做这个？我不该占用你这么多时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_f9e23f89:

    # "Furkan just smiles."
    "弗坎只是微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_02ce7ad8:

    # f "Even the chief needs a break once in a while. This is just what I needed."
    f "就连酋长也得偶尔休息一下。这正是我需要的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_2b5df11e:

    # "There is a faraway look in his eyes."
    "他的眼神飘向远方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_999507a1:

    # f "I have plenty of memories here."
    f "我在这里有很多回忆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_46012649:

    # f "When Kari and I were young, we would hide among the bushes and play hide and seek."
    f "我们小时候会躲在花丛里玩捉迷藏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b0de7255:

    # f "Cannot remember the last time we did anything remotely like that."
    f "我都想不起上次我们做类似事情是什么时候了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_777bb660:

    # e "Furkan..."
    e "弗坎..."

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_490c0458:

    # f "It is part of growing up, just did not expect now that we're both ruling over a tribe."
    f "这就是成长的一部分，只是没想到如今我们竟然都在统治一个部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_3ec57d49:

    # f "..."
    f "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_3420193f:

    # "Furkan changes his tone to something lighter."
    "弗坎将他的语气改成更轻一点的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_5a045dfa:

    # f "Speaking of the general, thank you for saving me last time."
    f "说起将军，还是要谢谢你上次救了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_883d47f8:

    # e "That was nothing."
    e "那没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_a4a5ea14:

    # f "Though, I would have preferred if you have handled the encounter with Kari non-confrontationally."
    f "不过，我更希望你当时能和卡里和平解决那场冲突。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_904a8994:

    # f "Steps towards truce will be hard if every go-to solution is violence."
    f "如果每次都用暴力解决问题，迈向停战的路会很难走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_cc6934a1:

    # e "I didn't mean to. I tried to explain myself but they attacked."
    e "我不是故意的。我试着解释，但他们先动手了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_009fd39c:

    # f "And I wish to apologize to you on their behalf. They were too worried to be thinking clearly."
    f "我也想代他向你道歉。他太担心了，没法冷静思考。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_8b500cfe:

    # f "Thankfully, no one got seriously injured."
    f "幸好没人受重伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_12f97466:

    # "Furkan gives you a reassuring smile."
    "弗坎给你一个安心的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_e936a061:

    # e "And I'm sorry too."
    e "我也很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_326d57d8:

    # f "Appreciate it."
    f "我很感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1839735a:

    # f "However, you might be getting some attitude from Kari."
    f "不过，你可能会受到卡里的一些冷言冷语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1ea97b2d:

    # e "Why?"
    e "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_f55cf9e9:

    # f "The man does not wear his emotions on his sleeves but I have known him since he was a wee fawn."
    f "他不轻易表露情绪，但我从他还是一只小鹿时就认识他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_004ebaf5:

    # f "His loss at your hands bothers him. Granted, he was not at his strongest at that moment in time."
    f "败在你手里让他很难受。当然，那时候他并不在最佳状态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_e25a33de:

    # f "But he prides himself on being the strongest fighter in the tribe... the loss of magic here hit him hard."
    f "但他一直以自己是部落里最强的战士为傲……这里魔力的消失对他打击很大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_4116d77d:

    # e "What can I do then?"
    e "那我能做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_a99b297c:

    # "Furkan shakes his head with a smile."
    "弗坎笑着摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_9dda09b4:

    # f "It is not what you need to do but what he needs to do."
    f "不是你该做什么，而是他该做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_da92c0d9:

    # f "I would advise him to let it go but I know he is too stubborn for it."
    f "我会劝他放下，但我知道他固执得很。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_57572bb3:

    # f "...in truth, he was disappointed that he was not in the cave."
    f "……说实话，他只是遗憾自己没在山洞里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1518291e:

    # e "Alright... I'll be careful next time."
    e "好吧……下次我会小心的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_ec281920:

    # f "I heard about your fight with Kari."
    f "我听说了你和卡里的战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b360207e:

    # "Your face blushes thinking back to that defeat."
    "想起那次落败，你的脸颊泛起红晕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_0dd6c55c:

    # e "I..."
    e "我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_f19ed38e:

    # "Furkan's tone turns serious."
    "弗坎的语气变得严肃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_42a30ca9:

    # f "You're lucky that we are not out to kill."
    f "你该庆幸我们不是奔着杀人去的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_37094268:

    # f "Well, maybe not Kari."
    f "不过卡里可能不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_c8d0b9e8:

    # f "Not everyone in the world will be as merciful."
    f "世上不是每个人都会像我们这样仁慈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b647f53c:

    # f "You need to toughen up."
    f "你得变强。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1fc00be2:

    # e "I will."
    e "我会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_750afe80:

    # f "Good. Kari would agree with me."
    f "很好。卡里肯定会赞同我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_37708619:

    # f "He mentioned seeing the potential in you."
    f "他说他看到了你的潜力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_26d47a8b:

    # e "Did he?"
    e "他说的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1b4d3091:

    # f "Yes, and he is rarely wrong with his appraisal."
    f "是，而且他的判断很少出错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_d66bbe98:

    # f "So train harder. The world is a dangerous place."
    f "那就更加努力地训练。这个世界很危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_8d7d00d5:

    # e "Thank you for the concern, Furkan."
    e "谢谢你的关心，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_34bef44c:

    # f "But who am I to talk to you about fights and conflicts considering all the harm the tribe has done to Lusterfield."
    f "但我是谁 来跟你谈谈战斗和冲突 考虑到部落对乐斯民菲尔德造成的伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b03a33c7:

    # "You see a regretful twinge in Furkan's smile."
    "你从弗坎的笑容里看出一丝懊悔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_0383c348:

    # e "I'm sure you didn't mean for it to happen."
    e "我相信你也不是想让事情变成那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_1150de86:

    # f "That is nice of you to say but a war is a war. People got blinded by emotions."
    f "你这么说真好，但战争就是战争。人们被情绪蒙蔽了双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_dae2f07e:

    # f "I was not there, does not mean I did not make it happen."
    f "我当时不在那里，不代表这件事不是因我而起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_2486aec9:

    # f "Kari could have kidnapped you to torture for information just because he was worried about me."
    f "卡里可能只是因为担心我，就把你绑走，严刑逼供。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_99e801f0:

    # f "The same could be said of that war."
    f "那场战争也是如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_3529f1ae:

    # f "My people were out for revenge. A life for a life."
    f "我的族人是为了复仇而战。以命偿命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_c93dcf71:

    # f "We killed many and many were killed."
    f "我们杀了很多人，也有很多人被杀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_9dfae6ff:

    # "Furkan slides into silence."
    "弗坎滑入沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_760387ee:

    # "You just stay by his side quietly."
    "你只是安静地陪在他身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_83797185:

    # f "Was it worth?"
    f "值得吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_e950c8a9:

    # f "Families were left scattered, including my own."
    f "许多家庭支离破碎，我的家人也不例外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_4ad06120:

    # f "Just because we were all blinded by a temporary emotion."
    f "只因为我们都被一时的情绪蒙蔽了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_866e1e57:

    # f "As the chief, that is just the ghost that stays with me to my grave."
    f "作为酋长，这会是纠缠我至死的心魔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_777bb660_1:

    # e "Furkan..."
    e "弗坎..."

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_2685deec:

    # "You give him a comforting touch."
    "你安慰地碰了碰他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_099b5725:

    # e "At least you are trying to fix it now."
    e "至少你现在正在努力弥补。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_7198e351:

    # f "I do not think something like that can ever be fixed but I shall try my best."
    f "我不认为这种事能真正弥补，但我会尽力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_9bb13b8a:

    # f "But, that should not be something you need to worry about. But I am thankful that you allow me to get that out of my chest."
    f "但这不该是你需要担心的事。不过，谢谢你让我把这些话说出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_d2b2d8c6:

    # e "Anytime, Furkan."
    e "随时随地,弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_293a7e61:

    # f "I'm very impressed with how you've handled the encounter with Kari and the guards."
    f "你处理和卡里以及卫兵的冲突时，给我留下了深刻印象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_98fa2410:

    # "You blush at the compliment."
    "你因这句夸奖而脸红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_183f44c9:

    # e "I merely did what everyone would have done."
    e "我只是做了任何人都会做的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_deb8bb58:

    # f "That's not true. Not everyone can keep an open and rational mind at moments like that."
    f "那不是真的。不是每个人都能在那种时候保持开放而理智的头脑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_2d7004d7:

    # "You have a feeling Furkan is talking more than just the encounter you had with Kari."
    "你有种感觉 弗坎 不只是和你和卡里的会面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_f0e140a2:

    # f "Emotions get the better of people."
    f "人往往会被情绪左右。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_12846717:

    # f "Sometimes, they'd rather fight than talk."
    f "有时候，他们宁愿动手，也不愿好好谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_3a15838f:

    # "Furkan sighs."
    "弗坎 叹气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_6316c11a:

    # e "I'm sure things will turn out for the better."
    e "我相信事情会朝好的方向发展。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b2f23908:

    # f "Hope so. Cause what's the alternative?"
    f "希望如此。否则还能怎样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_65ef0dc2:

    # "Furkan gestures around him."
    "围绕他的弗坎手势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b2dbbcab:

    # f "Look around us."
    f "看看周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_acdc4d16:

    # "You do and are confused. The field is beautiful but that's about it."
    "你照做了，却感到困惑。这片田野很美，但也就仅此而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_59ee44dc:

    # e "Yes, the flowers are gorgeous."
    e "是啊，这些花真美。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_12d23130:

    # f "But no one is here to appreciate them."
    f "但没人来欣赏它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_72a5daad:

    # f "In the past, this place would be roaming with people from the tribe and Lusterfield, just enjoying their day in the sun."
    f "过去,这个地方会和来自部落和乐斯民菲尔德的人一起漫游, 享受他们在阳光下的日子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_8948316c:

    # f "But now, nothing."
    f "可现在，什么都没有了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_75f1f519:

    # f "The Lusterfolks does not come here after the war, and without support, our people have to retreat from the buggbears as well."
    f "战争之后，乐斯民菲尔德人不再来这里，而没有他们的支持，我们的族人也不得不躲避熊地精的侵扰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_777bb660_2:

    # e "Furkan..."
    e "弗坎..."

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_5937009a:

    # "Furkan shakes his head and picks himself up."
    "弗坎摇着头 抬起自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_b8b37730:

    # f "Sorry about that. Being here brings back many memories from the past."
    f "抱歉。来到这里勾起了许多往事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_cdbff688:

    # e "I'm sorry."
    e "对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_916f8424:

    # f "No need to apologize. I am glad to be back here and make new memory with a Lusterfolk."
    f "不用道歉。能回到这里，和一位乐斯民菲尔德人创造新的回忆，我很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Meet_Flower_e754d87c:

    # "You part with Furkan. It's time to return to Rahim with the mums."
    "你和弗坎分道扬镳 是时候和妈妈们一起回到雷希姆了。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_76c41dec:

    # "You look at the two goats slacking off on the barrels."
    "你看着两个山羊懒洋洋地靠在木桶上。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_15951bbb:

    # e "H-hey... aren't you guys supposed to be training?"
    e "嘿、嘿……你们不是该训练吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_d8d2238d:

    # gt "We are. Don't you see we're training our brains...?"
    gt "我们正在训练。你没看见我们在训练大脑吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_c18eb48e:

    # e "W-what?"
    e "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_5684a1fd:

    # gt "...Why are you outsider here anyway... aren't you supposed to be fucking around with the lusterfolks..."
    gt "……你这个外来者来这里干什么……你不是该和那些乐斯民菲尔德人鬼混吗……"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_db6f8434:

    # e "H-hey watch your mouth..."
    e "喂——说话放尊重点……"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_dd01cb77:

    # gt "Heh... no worries we all saw it when you fuck that buggbear."
    gt "呵……别担心，你和那只熊地精鬼混时，我们可都看见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_2d05bb27:

    # e "I d-didn't."
    e "我、我没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_2b38e02c:

    # gt "Perhaps that's why our chief has a liking of you."
    gt "也许这就是我们酋长喜欢你的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_097ffb2d:

    # gt "N-now... leave us alone. We're not training with these pieces of junk until the magics are back."
    gt "现、现在……别烦我们。魔力恢复之前，我们才不会拿这些破烂训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_b6c14cb6:

    # e "Why are you guys so stingy."
    e "你们怎么这么小气？"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_6c7f3d78:

    # gt "Because, that's none of your business. Ah, I know what you're doing, trying to beat us even in the school of magic?"
    gt "因为这不关你的事。啊，我知道你在打什么主意——想在魔法课上也赢过我们？"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_1e35e1ef:

    # e "So, are you jealous that I am more capable?"
    e "所以，你们是嫉妒我比你们更有本事？"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_795ce74b:

    # gt "H-hey! We're trained soldiers, not some random goat-lookalike non-goats going around like he's a hero just because he saved our chief."
    gt "嘿！我们可是受过训练的士兵，不是什么随便一个长得像山羊的非山羊，救了我们酋长就到处把自己当英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_3a22914a:

    # gt "You've got us scolded for not watching over our chief."
    gt "你害得我们因为没保护好酋长而挨了训。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_talking_sequence_6e95d101:

    # gt "N-now... leave us alone."
    gt "现、现在……别烦我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_3f1230e1:

    # "You look at the goat practicing archery in front of you, his hand is trembling a bit."
    "你看着面前那只练习射箭的山羊，他的手微微发抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_ae7fa8f2:

    # "He turns back at you."
    "他转过身来看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_eec3ccd7:

    # gt "I wish I can go back to using my staff, not bows and spears. It was much easier that way..."
    gt "我真希望能回去用法杖，而不是弓和长矛。那样容易多了……"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_cfed5b5b:

    # gt "..."
    gt "……"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_b52f9fcb:

    # gt "What's the matter with you...?"
    gt "你怎么了……？"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_e16e600a:

    # e "Hmm..." nointeract
    e "嗯……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_af3a5f73:

    # e "I want to train with you..."
    e "我想和你一起训练……"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_8380b43c:

    # gt "Well... I do need a training buddy, and it's not like the other goats are in mood for a battle..."
    gt "嗯……我确实需要一个训练伙伴，而且其他山羊也没心情打架……"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_08c5cd6c:

    # gt "Alright, give me all you got."
    gt "好吧，让我看看你的全部本事。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_854d6aae:

    # e "Hmm... I should go."
    e "嗯……我该走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite goat_training_battle_f999bd1a:

    # gt "Yeah, go. I've still got a cart worth of bull's eye to shoot."
    gt "对，走吧。我还有一车靶心要射呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_How_Doing_9aff63bd:

    # e "How are you doing, Furkan."
    e "你好吗,弗坎?"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_How_Doing_1f84e315:

    # f "I am reading paperworks."
    f "我在看文件。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_How_Doing_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_How_Doing_44637710:

    # "The chieftain stares at you, he seems to expect you to do something..."
    "酋长盯着你，似乎在等你做点什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_How_Doing_85e75e5e:

    # e "I'll leave you be for the moment."
    e "我先不打扰你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_How_Doing_5e823501:

    # f "Thank you, [e]."
    f "谢谢，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_End_dc8c519d:

    # e "That's all for now, Furkan."
    e "仅此而已,弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Dialogue_End_930f0f51:

    # f "Good. See you."
    f "好。回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_861df8dc:

    # "You hold the stained scroll in hand, and a familiar energy courses through your body."
    "你手里握着那卷沾污的卷轴，一股熟悉的能量流过你的身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c3a6eb57:

    # "Suddenly, the world around you shifts and blurs."
    "突然，周围的世界开始移动、模糊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c45f3f1e:

    # "And soon, you find yourself standing in a different place, a place filled with warmth and light."
    "很快，你发现自己站在另一个地方，一个充满温暖与光明的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_4c40c2b1:

    # "It was a long time ago, when Furkan had come of age, and a festival was held in the tribe."
    "那是很久以前,当弗坎长大了, 部落里举行了一个节日。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ff82cc4f:

    # "He remembered the day vividly, as if it was yesterday."
    "那一天的一切他都记得清清楚楚，仿佛就在昨天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_2d1baaaa:

    # "The night was lit with the warm glow of fire, and the air was filled with the sound of bells and laughter."
    "夜色被温暖的火光照亮，空气中回荡着铃铛声和笑声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_cb1b0ce1:

    # "Furkan was dressed in his ceremonial attire, a simple but elegant outfit that reflected his status as the chief's son."
    "弗坎穿着礼服, 简单但优雅的服装, 反映了他作为酋长的儿子的地位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_d2e07fda:

    # "He had been chosen to lead the ceremony later, it was a great honor for a young goat like him, as everyone is looking up towards the future leader of the tribe."
    "他被选中在稍后主持仪式，对他这样年轻的山羊来说是莫大的荣誉，因为所有人都在仰望部落未来的领袖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_24c67aba:

    # "Furkan stood alone, his eyes darted around, skimming through the faces of countless jubilant goats."
    "弗坎独自站着,眼睛转来转去,在无数欢乐的山羊的面孔中偷窥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_fa21a46b:

    # "Some were dancing, some were singing, and some were just sitting around the fire, enjoying the warmth."
    "有人在跳舞，有人在歌唱，也有人只是围坐在火堆旁享受温暖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_41f72901:

    # "Stalls were set up all around, selling food and drinks, the smell of sweet treats wafted through the air."
    "四周搭起了摊位，售卖食物和饮料，甜食的香气在空气中飘荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_609616ed:

    # "Furkan moved through the crowd, his hands were holding a box of cabbage cheese rolls, a delicacy that was only made during the festival."
    "弗坎在人群中移动,他的手拿着一盒卷心菜奶酪卷,这是节日才制作的美味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ef46ea57:

    # "He was greeting people and accepting their congratulations, all the while looking for someone."
    "他一边向人们打招呼、接受祝贺，一边寻找着某个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_88d79712:

    # tv "Furkan!"
    tv "弗坎!"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_f55c951b:

    # "Suddenly, a familiar voice called out to him. He turned around to see Tevfik, his father, the chief of the tribe, along with the elders following behind him."
    "突然，一个熟悉的声音呼唤他。他转过身，看见特夫菲克——他的父亲、部落的酋长——身后还跟着几位长老。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_b5405dfe:

    # tv "Furkan, my son, come here."
    tv "我的儿子弗坎,过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_f54eca03:

    # "The young goat walked over to his father, his heart pounding in his chest."
    "年轻的山羊走向父亲，心脏在胸腔里怦怦直跳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_4e23cbe2:

    # "Tevfik was an imposing figure, despite his tallness, his horns curved majestically, and his eyes were sharp and piercing."
    "特夫菲克身材高大，气势逼人；他的角威严地弯曲着，双眼锐利而深邃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_fd28836b:

    # "The old goat has seen many battles in his times, but he was still standing strong, his presence commanding respect from every goat in the tribe."
    "这只老山羊一生经历过无数战斗，但依旧站得笔直、强健，威严让部落里的每只山羊都肃然起敬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_6a52f766:

    # f "Yes, father?"
    f "是，父亲？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_a9b1926d:

    # tv "My son, it has been a while... you have grown into a fine young goat, haven't you?"
    tv "我的儿子，好一阵子没见了……你已经长成一只出色的小伙子了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_de22021a:

    # tv "Today is a special day for you, and for our tribe."
    tv "今天对你、对我们的部落来说都是特殊的一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_0c4d3cbc:

    # "Tevfik placed a hand on Furkan's shoulder, his grip firm and reassuring."
    "Tevfik把手放在弗坎的肩膀上,他的握力坚固,令人放心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_1d82703d:

    # tv "You will help me lead the ceremony tonight, and I have no doubt you will do it well."
    tv "今晚你会帮我主持仪式，我相信你一定能做得很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_72a35e28:

    # f "I... I am honored, father, but I am not sure if I am ready."
    f "我……我很荣幸，父亲，但我不确定自己准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_cddcf1ac:

    # tv "You are ready, my son. My elders have taught you well, they told me you are a quick learner."
    tv "你已经准备好了，我的儿子。长老们把你教得很好，他们都说你学得很快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_dbdd6fc3:

    # "The elders nodded in agreement, as Tevfik broke into a soft smile."
    "长老们赞同地点点头，特夫菲克也露出了温和的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c8789a52:

    # tv "You will do great, I am sure of it. Everyone in the tribe is looking up to you, and they will be proud of you, regardless of the outcome."
    tv "你会做得很棒的，我对此深信不疑。部落里的每个人都对你寄予厚望，无论结果如何，他们都会为你感到骄傲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_9414a232:

    # f "Yes, father."
    f "是，父亲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_3b7498ab:

    # tv "...is there anything in your mind?"
    tv "……你是不是有什么心事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_766e96e2:

    # "Tevfik sensed hesitation in his son's voice, and he looked at him with concern."
    "特夫菲克察觉到儿子声音中的犹豫，关切地看着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c3fef5b4:

    # f "Where is Kari?"
    f "卡里呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_705f30eb:

    # "Furkan's voice was barely above a whisper, but Tevfik heard it nonetheless."
    "弗坎的声音几乎在耳语之上, 但Tevfik还是听到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ddaed51a:

    # tv "Kari...?"
    tv "卡里……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_dd94c39e:

    # "Tevfik's expression darkened for a moment, he looked down at the box, and he looked away, his eyes distant."
    "特夫菲克的神情暗了一瞬。他低头看向盒子，又移开视线，目光变得悠远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_a2106337:

    # tv "I had not seen him since the festival had begun, he was supposed to be here... somewhere."
    tv "节日开始后我就没见过他，他应该在这里……某个地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_14297a91:

    # tv "Do not worry about him, he knows his role, he will be here when the ceremony starts."
    tv "别担心他。他知道自己的职责，仪式开始时他会出现的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_2ab8f26c:

    # "Furkan nodded, but he could not shake the feeling of unease that settled in his stomach."
    "弗坎点头,但他无法动摇胃部不适的不安感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_957d13fa:

    # tv "Furk-"
    tv "弗坎——"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_adb5e4ea:

    # g "Ahem, Chief, there is something you need to see."
    g "咳，酋长，有件事你需要看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c135f23a:

    # "The vendor interrupted Tevfik as he approached them, a small device was in his hand, glowing faintly in bright blue."
    "小贩走过来打断了特夫菲克，手里拿着一个小装置，幽幽地发出明亮的蓝光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ace831ee:

    # "Tevfik looked at the device, before waving the elders away."
    "特夫菲克看了看装置，然后挥手让长老们离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_6b0afaef:

    # tv "Go and prepare for the ceremony, my son. I will be there when the time comes."
    tv "去为仪式做准备吧，我的儿子。时间到了我会到场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_75eff30f:

    # "Furkan nodded, and watched as his father walked away into the Ardent Cauldron, with bells and chimes ringing in the air."
    "弗坎点头,看着他父亲走进Ardent Cauldron, 空中响着钟声和铃声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_698ec04e:

    # f "Yes... father..."
    f "好……父亲……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_e195a607:

    # "The young goat stood there for a moment, and something suddenly crossed his eyes as he looks up at the night sky."
    "年轻的山羊站在那里片刻，抬头望向夜空时，眼中突然闪过一丝异样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_224d3279:

    # "Without hesitation, Furkan turned around and walked away from the festivities, his legs brisk with haste."
    "弗坎毫不犹豫地转过身来,走出了节日,他的腿急匆忙地转过身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_b31c509f:

    # "He trekked up the hill, he knew there was only one place where the mage-in-training would be."
    "他一路爬上山坡，知道受训中的法师只有一个地方会去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_31da276b:

    # "It was the lone hut over the cliff, disused by the chief long ago, but Kari and Furkan had made it their own little hideout since childhood."
    "那是悬崖上的一个独居小屋, 早就被头儿抛弃了, 但卡里和弗坎从小就把小屋 变成了他们自己的小藏身之处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_3329e40f:

    # "Furkan glanced at the dim light coming from the hut, and with excitement, he quickly peeked his head over the curtains."
    "弗坎看着从小屋发出的暗淡的光芒,他兴奋地迅速将头朝窗帘上偷看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_e9cc79c1:

    # f "Boo..."
    f "嘿……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_f7f61310:

    # "He spots the mage-in-training sitting on the floor, scribbling magic runes on his book, his back turned to Furkan."
    "他在书上发现了坐在地板上的在训练中的Mage- in-train 坐在地板上, 拼写着魔法符文, 他的背转向弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_1f2b5464:

    # f "Kari, what are you doing here?"
    f "卡里，你怎么在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ad4ed13d:

    # "Kari turned around, his eyes wide with surprise."
    "卡里转过身，惊讶得瞪大了眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_37e89e22:

    # k "Oh! Buckie! I'm sorry. I should be at the festival... what time is it?"
    k "哦！巴基！抱歉。我本该在节日现场……现在几点了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_45731374:

    # "Furkan walked into the hut, and sat down beside Kari."
    "弗坎走进小屋,坐在卡里旁边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_b129e8bc:

    # f "It's alright, I was just looking for you."
    f "没事，我只是来找你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_b4151c13:

    # f "Bought you some cheese rolls, in case you weren't going to the stalls this year."
    f "给你买了些芝士卷，以防你今年不去摊位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_7edab37b:

    # "Furkan put the box down on the table, Kari smiled, his hands busy with the book."
    "弗坎把盒子放在桌子上,卡里笑了,手忙着写书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_907c244e:

    # "Slowly, the deer's eyes grew more unfocused as he flipped over the page, until he finally closed the book and looked at Furkan."
    "慢慢地,鹿的眼神变得更加无重点 当他翻过页面, 直到他终于关闭了书 并看着弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_cf5c00eb:

    # k "So, are you ready for the ceremony?"
    k "那么，你准备好参加仪式了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_769c23c8:

    # f "I am, I think..."
    f "我想是吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c06c4e2c:

    # "Furkan sighed."
    "弗坎 叹息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ddfe63ad:

    # f "I don't know. I had to pour the flowing water into everyone's basin, and then I have to look at them and say some words..."
    f "我不知道。我得把流动的水倒进每个人的水盆里，然后看着他们，说一些祝词……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_dcb591fe:

    # f "All the while they are looking at me. Looking up to me... I don't know if I can do it."
    f "一直以来，他们都在看着我。仰望着我……我不知道自己能不能做到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_97cf05ea:

    # "Kari looked at Furkan, his eyes softening."
    "卡里看着弗坎, 他的眼睛软化。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ceb0856c:

    # k "You can do it, buckie. You are the chief's son, they won't fault you if you miss a word or two, not that you will."
    k "你能做到的，巴基。你是酋长的儿子，就算漏说一两句，他们也不会怪你——不过我相信你不会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_3dd5dfa5:

    # f "How can you be so certain? You have never done this before."
    f "你怎么能这么肯定？你以前从没做过这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_74842a99:

    # k "Yes, but I know you. And I know Tevfik, maybe you will do it better than him."
    k "没错，但我了解你。我也了解特夫菲克，也许你会比他做得更好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_9bb3287b:

    # "The young goat patted his back reassuringly, his fingers briefly grazing against the thin material of his cape."
    "年轻的山羊安抚地拍了拍他的后背，手指短暂地擦过他斗篷的薄料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_2b9f78b0:

    # "Furkan nodded, relieved."
    "弗坎点头,松开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_81166aff:

    # "He wanted to ask Kari about something, something he has been wanting to say for years now, but it was not the right time."
    "他想问卡里一件事，一件他想说了很多年的事，但现在不是时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_0906c9ef:

    # k "You will be the chief one day, and this is just the first step."
    k "你总有一天会成为酋长，而这只是第一步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_de12a77b:

    # f "Do you believe so?"
    f "你真的这么相信？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_2c3daae7:

    # "Furkan murmured, staring forward as if he's lost in thought."
    "弗坎 低声低语 望着前方 好像他迷失了思想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_078b4718:

    # f "I am not like father, I am not a warrior, I am not a leader. I am never ready to be a chief."
    f "我不像父亲，我不是战士，也不是领袖。我永远都没准备好当酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_681af883:

    # "Kari let out a small sigh, and placed a hand on top of Furkan's shoulder, his voice grew more serious."
    "卡里吐了一小口叹气 把手放在弗坎的肩膀上 他的声音越来越严重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_26cf2b13:

    # k "I wasn't ready to be a mage either, but I had no choice, I couldn't let my magic go to waste."
    k "我当初也没准备好成为法师，但我别无选择，不能让自己的魔力白白浪费。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_79feeeaf:

    # k "The same goes for you, you were born with that horn, that means you are the ones who leads the tribe. You might not feel ready yet, but that doesn't mean you aren't worthy."
    k "你也一样。你生来就有那支角，这意味着你就是带领部落的人。你也许还没做好准备，但这不代表你没有资格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_dc5f376a:

    # "Furkan looked at Kari, his eyes were filled with longing and uncertainty."
    "弗坎看着卡里, 他的眼睛充满了渴望和不确定性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_d23b4699:

    # f "But you never rest, ever since you started training under father... I cannot even remember the last time we saw each other."
    f "可自从你开始跟父亲训练后，你就从不停歇……我甚至想不起我们上次见面是什么时候了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_663b6962:

    # f "We used to walk around the festivals together, and you loved these rolls so much you'd eat the entire stalls worth of them, now you didn't even touch them."
    f "我们以前总一起逛节日，你特别喜欢这些芝士卷，能把整摊都吃光；可现在你连碰都没碰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_476e80cb:

    # "Kari frowned softly."
    "卡里轻轻地皱眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_2db20c47:

    # "The two of them fell into silence, and it was interrupted by the faint sound of bells ringing from the festival grounds."
    "两人陷入沉默，节日场地传来的隐约铃声打破了寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_de0a4563:

    # k "Buckie, am I distracting you?"
    k "巴基，我是不是打扰你了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c4c89f95:

    # "Kari whispered, his eyes lowered."
    "卡里压低目光，轻声说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_51852e3e:

    # k "I can see it in your eyes, you are not focused on the ceremony, instead you came all the way to look for me. And for what?"
    k "我从你的眼睛里看得出来，你根本没在专心想仪式，反而一路跑来找我。到底为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_952f970b:

    # "Furkan shook his head."
    "弗坎摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_1b01369e:

    # f "No, it's not that. I just... I miss you. And you have been so busy, I thought you were hiding away from me."
    f "不，不是那样。我只是……我想你了。而且你一直那么忙，我还以为你是在躲着我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_284a6cdb:

    # k "We can talk on our way down."
    k "我们下山的时候可以聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_f98f9aeb:

    # f "Kari, ever since we started training, all I have been thinking about was the hunting we used to do together, the adventures we had, the fun we had."
    f "卡里，自从我们开始训练以来，我满脑子想的都是以前一起打猎的日子、那些冒险，以及我们一起度过的快乐时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_3e51d8b8:

    # f "Sometimes... sometimes I wish things could stay like that forever."
    f "有时候……有时候我真希望一切能永远保持那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_243e2749:

    # k "The ceremony is about to star-"
    k "仪式马上就要开始——"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_5fe1d0c7:

    # f "I wish I could just be a normal goat, not the chief's son, not the one who has to lead the tribe. I just want to be with you, like we used to."
    f "我只想做一只普通的山羊，不是酋长的儿子，也不是那个必须带领部落的人。我只想和你在一起，就像从前那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c6af9165:

    # k "Buckie..."
    k "巴基……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_8f4744ba:

    # "He turned towards Furkan, their faces inches apart, and the young goat could smell the sweet scent coming from the deer."
    "他朝弗坎方向转过来,他们的脸被分开了几寸, 年轻的山羊闻到了鹿香味的香味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_78decdcd:

    # f "Do you never miss those days? When we were just two kids, running around the forest, climbing on top of the mountain and sleeping under the stars?"
    f "你就从来不会想念那些日子吗？那时我们只是两个孩子，在森林里到处跑，爬上山顶，在星空下睡觉？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_97cf05ea_1:

    # "Kari looked at Furkan, his eyes softening."
    "卡里看着弗坎, 他的眼睛软化。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_24ba13be:

    # k "You cannot be like this, buckie. You are the chief's son, you have to be there when the bell rings."
    k "你不能这样，巴基。你是酋长的儿子，钟声响起时你必须到场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_8b227a80:

    # "Furkan felt his heart pounded against his chest, and he held himself back from embracing his childhood friend."
    "弗坎感觉他的心脏 敲打他的胸部, 他阻止自己 拥抱他的童年朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_b50b1f5d:

    # "Instead, he swallowed his fears, and reached out to touch Kari's hand."
    "但他咽下恐惧，伸手去碰卡里的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_2d95891d:

    # f "Father will make sure everything goes well, just like every festival before."
    f "父亲会确保一切顺利，就像之前每一场节日一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_e890332f:

    # f "Please, Kari. Let me stay here a little longer."
    f "求你了，卡里。让我在这里再待一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_135025ee:

    # "The young goat moved closer, until the tips of their snouts touched each other's, and for a moment, everything seemed still."
    "年轻的山羊靠得更近，直到他们的鼻尖彼此相触，刹那间，万物仿佛静止。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_9b5738db:

    # f "Just stay here with me."
    f "就这样陪我待在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_3ed9dfe7:

    # "Kari looked at Furkan, unsure of what to say or do. Despite his reluctance to admit it, he remembered how it used to be."
    "卡里看着弗坎,不知道该说什么或做什么。 尽管他不愿意承认,他记得过去的情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_09713cd1:

    # "When they would climb the mountains and sleep together, sometimes Furkan would pull him into an embrace, just like how he is doing now."
    "当他们爬上山来睡在一起时 有时弗坎会把他拉入拥抱 就像他现在一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_bd33250e:

    # "His mind was filled with old memories, of the countless nights where he stayed awake just to hear the sound of Furkan's breath as he slept beside him."
    "他的脑海充满了旧的记忆 无数的夜晚 他在那里保持清醒 仅仅听到弗坎呼吸的声音 当他睡在他身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_119dbb5f:

    # "Back then, he couldn't see the world beyond the mountains, but now... He looked at Furkan, at his unwavering gaze and the faint smile on his lips."
    "那时，他看不见群山之外的世界，但如今……他望着弗坎，望着他坚定不移的目光，以及唇边淡淡的微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_c0267827:

    # "Those days were long gone, but not their feelings, they never changed."
    "那些日子早已过去，但他们的感情没有变，从未改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_372b06a0:

    # "For a moment, Kari hesitated, but then he found himself leaning in closer."
    "卡里犹豫了一会儿 但他发现自己靠得更近了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_fb65eb7d:

    # "Their lips touched briefly, just like how they had brushed against each other by the waterfall when they were younger."
    "他们的嘴唇短暂相触，就像年少时在瀑布边彼此擦过的唇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_2237817b:

    # "It lasted no more than a second, but it was enough to send shivers down their spine."
    "只持续了不到一秒，却足以让他们脊背发颤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_7bbbb0b4:

    # "A soft moan escaped Furkan's mouth, and he leaned in for another kiss, this time Kari met him halfway."
    "一只柔软的呻吟从弗坎的嘴里逃出来 他靠进来又接吻了 这次卡里在半路上遇见了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_8fe8af71:

    # "The deer mage wrapped his arms around Furkan, pulling him close."
    "鹿群在弗坎周围把他的手臂包起来 拉近他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_8fffa4c9:

    # k "Buckie...?"
    k "巴基……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_392f835b:

    # k "What if... What if someone sees us?"
    k "如果……如果有人看见我们怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ce24fda6:

    # f "They won't."
    f "不会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_4a77562e:

    # "He reached out to grab Kari's hand, guiding them under the table."
    "他伸手抓住卡里的手，带着他躲到桌下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ea9422c0:

    # f "Father will be busy with the ceremony."
    f "父亲会忙着主持仪式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_e3aafc76:

    # "He murmured, pushing the deer further down onto the floor."
    "他低声说道，把那只鹿进一步压到地板上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_ed86801d:

    # "He couldn't shake off the feeling of unease that had settled in his stomach. That he enjoyed being with Furkan like this."
    "他无法摆脱胃里那股不安感——他居然喜欢这样和弗坎待在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_4b6e119c:

    # "It seemed he had led Furkan towards a path further away from being a good chief, to a path he would be indulging in his own desires rather than the needs of the tribe."
    "似乎他已经带领弗坎走上一条道路,远离一个好酋长,走向一条他将沉溺于自己欲望而不是部落需求的道路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_b5c393e7:

    # "Even if he intended to continue, Tevfik would have him plenty known that such a thing is impossible."
    "即使他打算继续下去，特夫菲克也会让他清楚地知道这种事不可能发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_3bf7baa1:

    # "Kari watched Furkan slowly walk down the hills, and as he did so, the smile on his face faded away."
    "卡里看着弗坎慢慢地走下山丘,他这样做,他脸上的微笑消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_640c07dd:

    # "Tonight he was reminded of the warm embrace of his own childhood friend, but he knew that he could never tell anyone what truly happened between them tonight."
    "今晚，他想起了儿时好友温暖的拥抱，但他知道，今晚两人之间真正发生的一切，他永远无法告诉任何人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_448d38e5:

    # "Kari sighed, he stared at the box of cabbage cheese rolls, he picked out one of them and took a bite."
    "卡里叹息后,盯着卷心菜芝士卷的盒子, 挑出其中一个,咬了一口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_64df09ef:

    # "His eyes watered as he chewed alone in the dark room, the roll was cold, but the taste of Furkan's seed still lingering in his mouth."
    "他的眼睛在黑暗的房间里被单独咀嚼时被浇水,卷子很冷,但弗坎的种子的味道仍在口中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_71205807:

    # "Putting the half-eaten roll away, he hesitantly picked up the scrolls soaked with their own seeds, cleaning after the mess for the rest of the night."
    "他把吃了一半的芝士卷收起来，迟疑地拿起那些浸满他们精液的卷轴，收拾残局，直到夜深。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_1cccd4ef:

    # "Along the path towards the tribe center, Furkan checked his clothes for any residue."
    "在通往部落中心的路上,弗坎检查了他的衣服,以寻找残留物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_47cf3bbe:

    # "He didn't intend to make love with his best friend up there, but it felt so natural and right, as if they were meant to be together."
    "他本没打算在那上面和最好的朋友做爱，但这一切感觉自然而正确，仿佛他们注定要在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_5ea907c9:

    # "The thought was all over his head, up until he walked to the entrance of the ceremony."
    "直到他走到仪式入口前，这个念头一直盘旋在脑海中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_719a01c1:

    # "He took a deep breath, and stepped to the side of Tevfik."
    "他深吸一口气，走到特夫菲克身旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_8738f0a4:

    # tv "You're late, my son."
    tv "你迟到了，我的儿子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_d7c55b71:

    # "Furkan felt a knot tighten in his stomach as he looked at his father, staring into the ceremony."
    "弗坎看着他的父亲,盯着仪式看,肚子感到结紧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_b3371096:

    # "There is a tinge of undiscernable anger in his voice, but Furkan knew better than to question if he knew anything."
    "他的声音里带着一丝难以辨认的怒意，但弗坎很清楚，自己最好不要去问父亲是不是知道了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_d760d6a5:

    # f "Sorry, I got caught up with something-"
    f "对不起，我刚才被事情绊住了——"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_a28e69a0:

    # tv "Make sure it doesn't happen again."
    tv "别再有下次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_d08fa283:

    # "Furkan nodded slowly."
    "弗坎 慢点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Furkan_Festival_9414a232_1:

    # f "Yes, father."
    f "是，父亲。"
